Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: motif_discovery (validates ADR 0016)
Purpose:
    Confirm that sample-score-select finds dominant structural motifs
    on the canonical mixed graph — including the asymmetric tree
    structure that ADR 0015's residual note flagged as unreachable
    via compound-class discovery.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0016 (DiscoveryConfig, MotifCandidate, discover_motifs,
    xorshift64 PRNG, random-walk sampling).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0016.
    Runner: v2/examples/motif_discovery.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example motif_discovery

